        "name": "USN-4986-4",
        "description": "USN-4986-1 fixed a vulnerability in rpcbind. The update caused a regression resulting in rpcbind crashing in certain environments. This update fixes the problem for Ubuntu 14.04 ESM and Ubuntu 16.04 ESM.  Original advisory details:   It was discovered that rpcbind incorrectly handled certain large data  sizes. A remote attacker could use this issue to cause rpcbind to consume  resources, leading to a denial of service.",
